THIRD-PARTY DATA AND MODELS

Protein structure coordinates in data/proteins/pdb/ are distributed by RCSB PDB
(https://www.rcsb.org/) under the CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication.

The machine-learning bundle in models/ and the datasets in data/ml/ are
DEMONSTRATION ARTIFACTS. Their training labels are a synthetic public-data
proxy, not experimental measurements. Their declared approved use is
"DASHBOARD_AND_API_INTEGRATION_TESTING_ONLY". They must not be used for
scientific inference or cited as evidence about protein radiation tolerance.

